  "title": "IP: Enhance display of Unknown option",
  "description": "Add display filter for type, len and data\n\nDisplay before\n```\n   Options: (8 bytes)\n        Unknown (0x9a) (8 bytes)\n```\nDisplay After:\n```\n   Options: (8 bytes)\n        Unknown (0x9a) (8 bytes)\n            Type: 154\n                1... .... = Copy on fragmentation: Yes\n                .00. .... = Class: Control (0)\n                ...1 1010 = Number: Unknown (26)\n            Length: 8\n            Data: 50000500910a\n```",
